  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "All high-transfer experimental analogues show rapid and meaningful brain uptake across multiple species, including human PET data, brain-to-blood distribution, and non-efflux evidence. The query shares relevant piperazine and aryl amide features with these CNS-penetrant molecules, supporting a pass prediction.",
